::meta{crate: catasto-manifest, dependencies: list(), dependents: list(catasto-core, catasto-git)}

=[catasto-manifest]

`catasto-manifest` -- manifest syntax, schema models, and AST/CST editing for catasto.

Defines the structure and AST/CST manipulation of `catasto.ctmt` declarations,
upstream maps, sources, symlink options, and content lockfiles.
